  "definition": "Claims Settlement Time Limits",
  "effectiveDate": "2021-04-26",
  "historyNote": "#1900, eff 1-1-82; ss by #4287, eff 7-1-87; ss by #5649, eff 7-1-93; ss by #6999, eff 5-24-99, EXPIRED: 5-24-07 New. #8900, eff 7-1-07, EXPIRED: 10-26-15 New. #10962, eff 10-26-15; ss by #13173, eff 4-26-21",
